{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter","id":1180692,"title":"Dragon Blooded Kickstarter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-30T06:48:03-08:00","id":1180692,"title":"Dragon Blooded Kickstarter?","content":"Someone knows the estimated time Dragon Blooded Kickstarter will be live?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17573-andreabertocci","name":"Andreabertocci","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T07:03:39-08:00","id":1180696,"title":"","content":"I think we\u2019re still several months away from that, although not too many now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T07:24:22-08:00","id":1180700,"title":"","content":"The Trinity Continuum Kickstarter is running through February, so not till afterwards. If Dragon-Blooded is next... depending on how long a break between KSs they take, it could be anywhere from mid-March to late April. If it's the next one after that, then later still.<br /> <br /> But I'd at least hazard it'll be over and done by GenCon 2018, which is the beginning of August.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T07:47:44-08:00","id":1180709,"title":"","content":"huh, I had thought the KS was going to be up February.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T09:27:51-08:00","id":1180758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1180709#post1180709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">huh, I had thought the KS was going to be up February.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had hoped so too, as that would have been a lovely birthday present. But such is life.<br /> <br /> I know that it has been said that they want to have the DB manuscript 100% finished before they do the KS, so it\u2019s possible they\u2019re not quite finished revising it and then there\u2019s the KS schedule they need to fit it into as well. I doubt they were going to put the launch of an entire new gameline on hold for anything, so Exalted and everything else needed to work around that.<br /> <br /> That said, the only other thing Kickstarter worthy on the list that\u2019s anywhere close to the DB book is Geist 2e and it\u2019s still back in first pass Development (Hunter 2e is even earlier) so, unless something unforeseen happens, it kinda feels like DBs should be next.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T09:36:00-08:00","id":1180764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1180758#post1180758\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I had hoped so too, as that would have been a lovely birthday present. But such is life.<br /> <br /> I know that it has been said that they want to have the DB manuscript 100% finished before they do the KS, so it\u2019s possible they\u2019re not quite finished revising it and then there\u2019s the KS schedule they need to fit it into as well. I doubt they were going to put the launch of an entire new gameline on hold for anything, so Exalted and everything else needed to work around that.<br /> <br /> That said, the only other thing Kickstarter worthy on the list that\u2019s anywhere close to the DB book is Geist 2e and it\u2019s still back in first pass Development (Hunter 2e is even earlier) so, unless something unforeseen happens, it kinda feels like DBs should be next.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pugmire's Fetch Quest is also slated for a Kickstarter, and it's pretty far along.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T09:38:15-08:00","id":1180767,"title":"","content":"Ah drats. At least I have scion and trinity to tied me over till then but I never got the chance to back the original kickstarter so I'm looking forward to this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T09:39:04-08:00","id":1180768,"title":"","content":"In addition to what BrilliantRain said, I think the intended goal was to have the book release shortly after the time the Kickstarter ended. Also, even if they were ready to start the KS today, OP only does 1 KS at a time so they have to wait for a slot in their schedule. When Vance was asked a month ago about stretch goals for the DB KS, he hadn't even talked with Rich about it yet. So yeah April feels more likely than Feb at this stage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T09:47:16-08:00","id":1180772,"title":"","content":"I think we should get some Kickstarter-themed April Fools charm sets this year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T10:00:33-08:00","id":1180778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div clas