mes!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Avatar by Raven &amp; Blue Jay.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/663-aleks","name":"Aleks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar663_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:16:55-08:00","id":1185604,"title":"","content":"Hah, in my next game I\u2019m totally having that giant monster as a fight with that sweet lightning trident as loot in its gullet, I love art that instantly gives me ideas for a whole session. Maybe even have it\u2019s evocations not turn off after it\u2019s last wielded perishes so now the beast breathes lightning when it opens it\u2019s mouth to swallow you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T09:28:53-08:00","id":1185606,"title":"","content":"I wondered if that's not an evocation, but Air-aspected charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T10:46:11-08:00","id":1185645,"title":"","content":"Ooooo, pretty!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T11:32:05-08:00","id":1185672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1185604#post1185604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hah, in my next game I\u2019m totally having that giant monster as a fight with that sweet lightning trident as loot in its gullet, I love art that instantly gives me ideas for a whole session. Maybe even have it\u2019s evocations not turn off after it\u2019s last wielded perishes so now the beast breathes lightning when it opens it\u2019s mouth to swallow you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be tempted to put the trident in the monster's eyeball instead so the PCs can steal it during the fight and use it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T12:00:15-08:00","id":1185681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1185606#post1185606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wondered if that's not an evocation, but Air-aspected charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, right that may be true, I\u2019ve been looking through the core and arms recently so that kind of just jumped to my immidaite assumption. I\u2019m not sure though it looks a little grand and widespread, more sorcery\u2019s like blue jade-orichacum weapon or something. Well see either way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1180692-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1185672#post1185672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd be tempted to put the trident in the monster's eyeball instead so the PCs can steal it during the fight and use it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Officially stolen...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 02-13-2018, 03:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-13T12:56:00-08:00","id":1185701,"title":"","content":"Officially hyped:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">One of the reasons we\u2019ve held off on KSing Dragon Blooded has been to be sure we have a completed manuscript. Partly that was because of how we\u2019ve been doing the KS with the manuscript releases, and partly because we are aware of how much trust we burned away in the EX community with the EX3 Kickstarter. We want to deliver quickly after the KS is over (which isn\u2019t the week after, but could be months instead of years) and we want to be able to demonstrate that the text, which took so long before, has all been taken care of already. So I\u2019m pretty sure that we\u2019ll deliver the full text during the KS, although at worst there will be excerpts that equal \u201cmostly\u201d all of it.&quot; - Rich</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\